<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Home - Carpet Haven</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('./partials/navbar') %>

    <div class="container" style="text-align: center; padding: 60px 20px;">
        
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; color: #2c3e50; margin-bottom: 15px;">Welcome to Carpet Haven</h1>
        
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 35px; line-height: 1.8;">
            Discover our exquisite collection of premium carpets. Whether you need a precise custom-cut fit or a beautiful ready-made rug, we have the perfect piece to elevate your home.
        </p>
        
        <a href="/carpets" style="background-color: #4a5d4e; color: white; padding: 12px 30px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 1.1rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-weight: bold;">
            Browse Our Collection
        </a>

        <!-- قسم المميزات بثلاث بطاقات بسيطة -->
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 30px; margin-top: 70px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
            
            <div style="background: #fff; padding: 25px 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #eaeaea; width: 260px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #8c6d46; font-size: 1.2rem;">Custom Measurements</h3>
                <p style="color: #555; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0;">Tailor-made carpets cut exactly to fit your room's unique dimensions.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="background: #fff; padding: 25px 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #eaeaea; width: 260px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #8c6d46; font-size: 1.2rem;">Home Installation</h3>
                <p style="color: #555; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0;">Professional fixing and neat border edging services right at your doorstep.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="background: #fff; padding: 25px 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #eaeaea; width: 260px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
                <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #8c6d46; font-size: 1.2rem;">Premium Quality</h3>
                <p style="color: #555; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 0;">High-quality imported materials offering the best thickness and durability.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
    
</body>
</html>